# Generated QA output — screenshots, screen recordings and console dumps
# produced by the scripts in qa/. Listed individually on purpose: this repo
# deliberately TRACKS some QA assets (qa/responsive-b-final/*.png and three
# root *-qa.zip archives), so broad rules like qa/**, *.png or *.zip must not
# be used here. Add a new line when a new capture directory appears.
/qa 2/
/qa/phase-5-blob-journey/
/qa/phase-5-blob-journey-final/
/qa/phase-5-runtime-final/
/qa/phase-5-runtime-final-webgl/
/phase-5-blob-journey-qa.zip
/phase-5-current-videos.zip
/phase-5-final-qa.zip
/phase-5-runtime-final-webgl.zip
